  dialouge: <size=70%>Thank you for working with us on important Dragon and Dinosaur
    conservation work. Because of increased poaching of these magnificent creatures,
    their populations are declining, even in their natural habitats. This hatchery
    is a way for us to try and stabilize the populations and give back to creatures
    so vital to our world
